
%9Syntax:%9

@SYNTAX:listnick@

%9Description:%9

    Lists the kept nicks: "Keeping <nick> in [network] (active)", or
    "(inactive)" when keeping is paused after a manual nick change. A
    nick kept by keepnick_auto for one connection says "this connection"
    as well. An empty list prints "No nicks in keep list".

%9Examples:%9

    /LISTNICK

%9See also:%9 KEEPNICK, UNKEEPNICK

